<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f6f8; color:#333; margin:0; padding:0; }
    .container { max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; padding:32px; }
    .header { text-align:center; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:2px solid #ff6b35; }
    .header img { max-width:120px; }
    h1 { color:#ff6b35; }
    .amount { font-size:28px; font-weight:bold; color:#28a745; margin:16px 0; }
    .grid { display:table; width:100%; margin:20px 0; }
    .grid-cell { display:table-cell; padding:16px; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px; text-align:center; }
    .grid-label { font-size:12px; color:#777; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .grid-value { font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#333; }
    .footer { font-size:12px; color:#777; margin-top:32px; text-align:center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="https://app-urban-rush.vercel.app/Logo-png.png" alt="UrbanRush" />
      <h1>Resumen semanal de liquidación 📊</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Hola <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>Procesamos tu liquidación de la semana del <strong>{{week_start}}</strong> al <strong>{{week_end}}</strong>.</p>

    <div class="amount">Total liquidado: $ {{total_amount}} COP</div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="grid-cell">
        <div class="grid-label">{{operations_label}}</div>
        <div class="grid-value">{{operations_count}}</div>
      </div>
      {{#if commission_total}}
      <div class="grid-cell" style="margin-left:8px;">
        <div class="grid-label">Comisión retenida</div>
        <div class="grid-value">$ {{commission_total}}</div>
      </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>

    <p>El dinero ya está en camino a tu cuenta bancaria registrada. Recibirás otro correo cuando la transferencia se complete.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>UrbanRush — Liquidaciones automáticas</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
